# are rendered here so the SDK's KMSClient can address the right key;
# credentials reach the backend container via IAM Roles Anywhere, not
# this file. See docs/PHASE_5A_IAM_ROLES_ANYWHERE_PLAN.md plus the
# docker-compose AWS_USE_ROLES_ANYWHERE=true / AWS_CONFIG_FILE=
# /root/.aws/config block on the VPS.
