# Maximum per-wallet operator capital at risk across open curated work:
# reserved rewards plus brokered gas, denominated in USDC. At the current
# roughly 10-USDC reward bank, 2.5 prevents one wallet from monopolising the
# rail while leaving generous room for normal sequential work.
WORKER_OPEN_EXPOSURE_CAP_USDC=2.5
# Rolling 24-hour spend per wallet in USDC base units. Successful claims keep
# consuming this deposit-blind base after settlement. Only wallets graduated
# through verified catalogue work use the renewing window.
